**Note:** The MIT License above applies only to the open-source components in
this repository — specifically the source code under:

- `src/library/` — yyzlib, the shared utility library
- `src/updater/` — the auto-update component
- `src/yyzcmd/` — the command-line system command executor
- `src/inputhint/` — keyboard & mouse input visualizer
- `src/mousefinder/` — mouse pointer locator

The main yyzTools application — including the command palette, the module
system, the file indexing engine and all built-in tool pages — remains
proprietary software and is not covered by this license.

