# Third-Party Open Source Software Acknowledgments

yyzTools is proprietary software that is available for free use.

The software incorporates several excellent open-source software and libraries, to which we express our gratitude:

## Frontend Framework & Build Tools

- **[Alpine.js](https://alpinejs.dev/)** - Lightweight frontend framework (MIT License)
- **[Vite](https://vitejs.dev/)** - Next-generation frontend build tool (MIT License)
- **[i18next](https://www.i18next.com/)** - Internationalization framework (MIT License)

## Code Editor

- **[CodeMirror 6](https://codemirror.net/)** - Code editor (MIT License)
  - Supports multiple languages: HTML, JSON, Markdown, PHP, XML, etc.

## Documentation & Media Processing

- **[PDF.js](https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/)** - PDF rendering library (Apache License 2.0)
- **[docx-preview](https://github.com/mwilliamson/node-docx-preview)** - Word document preview (MIT License)
- **[pptx-preview](https://github.com/SDDTech/pptx-preview)** - PowerPoint document preview (MIT License)
- **[ViewerJS](https://viewerjs.org/)** - Image viewer (MIT License)
- **[html2canvas](https://html2canvas.hertzen.com/)** - Screenshot library (MIT License)
- **[jsQR](https://github.com/cozmo/jsQR)** - QR code recognition (Apache License 2.0)
- **[qrcode](https://github.com/soldair/node-qrcode)** - QR code generation (MIT License)

## Text & Data Processing

- **[Marked](https://marked.js.org/)** - Markdown parser (MIT License)
- **[KaTeX](https://katex.org/)** - Math formula rendering (MIT License)
- **[Math.js](https://mathjs.org/)** - Math calculation library (Apache License 2.0)
- **[dayjs](https://day.js.org/)** - Date processing library (MIT License)
- **[XLSX](https://github.com/SheetJS/sheetjs)** - Excel processing library (Apache License 2.0)
- **[js-yaml](https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml)** - YAML parser (MIT License)
- **[fast-xml-parser](https://github.com/NaturalIntelligence/fast-xml-parser)** - XML parser (MIT License)
- **[smol-toml](https://github.com/smol-rs/smol-toml)** - TOML parser (MIT License)

## 3D Rendering

- **[Three.js](https://threejs.org/)** - 3D graphics library (MIT License)
- **[three-dxf-loader](https://github.com/vkunitsky/three-dxf-loader)** - DXF file loader (MIT License)

## Utilities

- **[color](https://github.com/Qix-/color-convert)** - Color conversion library (MIT License)
- **[opencc-js](https://github.com/nighc/opencc-js)** - Traditional/Simplified Chinese conversion (MIT License)
- **[text-encoding](https://github.com/inexorabletext/text-encoding)** - Text encoding (MIT License)

## Microsoft Official Libraries

- **[Microsoft WebView2](https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/)** - Web hosting framework
- **[Microsoft Windows Implementation Library](https://github.com/microsoft/wil)** - Windows library (MIT License)
- **[Microsoft CppWinRT](https://github.com/microsoft/cppwinrt)** - C++/WinRT library (MIT License)

## Third-Party Executable Tools

### System & File Utilities

- **[7-Zip](https://www.7-zip.org/)** - File compression tool (LGPL)
- **[Everything](https://www.voidtools.com/)** - Fast file search tool
- **[Aria2](https://github.com/aria2/aria2)** - Multi-protocol download tool (GPLv2)

### Multimedia & Image Processing

- **[FFmpeg](https://ffmpeg.org/)** - Multimedia processing framework (GPL/LGPL)
- **[ImageMagick](https://imagemagick.org/)** - Image conversion and processing (GPL/LGPL)

### Document & OCR

- **[Ghostscript](https://www.ghostscript.com/)** - PDF and PostScript interpreter (GPL)
- **[pdfCPU](https://pdfcpu.io/)** - PDF processing toolkit (MIT License)
- **[RapidOCR-json](https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOCR)** - OCR text recognition tool
- **[Umi-OCR](https://github.com/hiroi-sora/Umi-OCR)** - OCR text recognition tool

### Security & Utilities

- **[OpenSSL](https://www.openssl.org/)** - Cryptography toolkit (Apache License 1.0/3.0)

## Fonts & Icons

- **[Font Awesome](https://fontawesome.com/)** - Icon font (MIT License)

